{"code": 1, "data": {"currentItemCount": 5, "index": 224, "itemList": [{"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2558/content00896?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>#<span style=\"color: #c91623; text-decoration: underline;\">一体化</span>供应链-标准解决方案</strong></em></span></a> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">行业痛点与方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #c91623; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行业痛点</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;1 </span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>人</strong></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">运营管理上人力资源投入多、人效低、考核困难；招工难、人员流动大</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;2 </span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>货</strong></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">货物破损、丢失成本高；危险品监管困难；人找货效率低</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;3 </span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>设备</strong></span></em><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">设备多类型、跨厂商，信息采集困难，管理高度分散化；日常维保、统计分析工作繁重；被动式监控，无法及时收到设备异常消息</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;4 </span></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>场</span></em></strong><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">缺乏统一管控及展示平台，关键决策信息分散在不同的地方；消防事件、安全事故风险高，造成损</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">失较大</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #2576e8; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解决方案</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;1 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>人员管理</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">通过摄像头、电子标签等设备对场地人员识别管理、保证用工安全</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>货物监管</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">利用3D可视化、AI视觉及各种传感器技术，实现库存管理、货物保全等，保障商品安全</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>设备监控</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">一套系统管理多地、多仓、多种类、多品牌设备，随时随地掌握设备运行情况</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;4 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>场地监控</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">利用流媒体设备、环境传感器等对场地视频、温湿度、能耗等进行监控</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">设备监控</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">通过场地设备集中管理与数据统计分析，移动端随时随地查看生产环节与设备运行的关键指标以及趋势信息、实时接收设备异常告警，PC端查看设备运行与效率明细数据，提升了解生产实况的便捷性、降低异常响应时间。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/78900/25/22326/67962/63ef1885F43da9803/59d17bb90400598f.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>人员管理</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">提供用工管理数字化工具，通过智能化对场地人员的在岗情况进行监控，在小程序端实时展现场地内各业务区域人数，推送用工异常告警，规避危险行为及用工低效效的问题。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/177377/12/33013/113068/63ef1896Fdd76dfae/0042eb2fb9184ed1.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">货物监管</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">提供3D可视化库存管理基础服务、AIoT智能监管增值服务，针对不同场景和需求，推出基于AI视觉、流媒体系统、巡检机器人等多种智能监控方案，实现货物全场、全角度监管。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/164446/2/34072/418968/63ef18b5F9e95ea56/9e82bc41ff978211.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">场地监控</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">基于实时视频、机器视觉、环境传感器、定位系统等实现全场地监管、消防环境状态泛感知，为生产场地安全防损、消防保驾护航。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/170607/6/34824/90057/63ef18c3Fe821e753/de7136a71c3d8acc.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">成功案例</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">某大型物流场地全场景数字化</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">该分拣中心自动化程序较高，但数字化程度低，面临运营效率低、用工管理、设备统一监控、安全生产等方面的痛点京东物控通过创新数字化、智能化产品建立人、货、场、设备等全要素监管控，推动场地数字化升级，落地敏捷生产运营管理模式，显著提升关键运营指标。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/93611/17/34312/237991/63ef18e2Ff80a8735/6bcca1d9813c7418.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/151142/12/30422/43354/63f2db0aF3c1feffc/e62957f4886fae90.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01052", "contentTitle": "软件产品-京东物控数字孪生", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1676426193000, "id": 2848, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "resCode": "100097", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/105757/2/31998/11356/63ef4e41Fb944d3de/22be5a3e1a5effe3.png", "updateTime": 1676860174000}, {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2558/content00896?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>#<span style=\"color: #c91623; text-decoration: underline;\">一体化</span>供应链-标准解决方案</strong></em></span></a> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">行业痛点与方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行业痛点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;1 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>人工作业成本越来越高仓储效率要求越来越高</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;2 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>面对不同业务需要使用不同类型的自动化设备，多种设备类型集成复杂度高</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;3 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>对于无人化的自动化物流场景，需要及时的异常监控及处理</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;1 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>通过智能化设备集成替代人工作业，实现少人化或无人化的场景应用，提升生产作业效率</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>支持20+种主流自动化设备集成，通过配置化方式实现多种设备的串联集成及调度策略</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>支持2D&amp;3D多种方式可视化监控，通过实时的异常监控能力和完整的异常处理能力保证现场稳定生产</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">配置化项目落地</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">通过对通信接口、业务流程、任务策略的全过程配置化方式实施交付，并通过实际场景还原搭建的方式快速绘制物流场景，绘制完成后通过适当的参数设置即可完成自动化物流场景的系统实现，可快速完成自动化物流场景的交付。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/120856/9/33932/206425/63ee0552F1fa2d3a2/edb4286c4098665f.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">智能调度</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">系统内置丰富的策略算法包，可为不同场景提供不同的策略算法，实现不同的调度管理需求。并且可通过参数化形式调整配置，现场生产运行时可根据实际生产情况调整参数，以满足最优化生产效率。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/123122/30/35143/85112/63ee0564F02ba2ff7/088cfd152eb403c0.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">全面可视化监控</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-heigh