fs/t1/142225/15/20930/107954/63ea03d1F8f340757/7fcd02bf524adc7b.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">5、选择“<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/ecology/cooperation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">意向合作</a>”后填写表单信息，销售人员会主动联系。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/ecology/cooperation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/223681/20/17056/284442/63ea03d6F79a5f548/a4da7c31be7198d0.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">6、手机端也可以按同样路径找到商家工作台，即：打开手机浏览器，使用搜索引擎搜索关键词“京东物流”后点击进入，或点击 <span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.jdl.com</a></strong></span> </span>直接访问。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/129672/8/31071/45562/63ea0468F3ff97254/4d5cb65e523aaeaf.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br/><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">7、进入手机端官网，左上角找到导航栏-服务支持-商家服务，可以找到<strong>商家工作台</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/98719/29/33071/49181/63ea046fFcf69e956/b7dffe7913864db4.png\"/> <img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/112814/28/19591/20742/63ea0474F4a1ee7ab/a119bd327a9f1d06.png\"/></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/142877/5/33430/43354/63e9f0b3Fb698e07a/59391fafd0307d6b.png\"/></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "京东物流官网，登录京东物流商家工作台的方式", "contentCode": "content01049", "contentTitle": "京东物流商家工作台登录入口在哪？", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1676272459000, "id": 2845, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "resCode": "100097", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/147945/13/29792/46747/63e9e714F6594be31/19cfdfaed14d5676.jpg", "updateTime": 1678761959000}, {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <strong><em><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2396/content00795?type=0\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">#链产品&nbsp;</span></a></em></strong> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">引言</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">电商行业对物流有着很高的依赖性，运输成本、时效与质量都直接影响到商家收益及用户消费体验。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">数据显示，在触点越来越丰富的互联网时代，为了获得更多流量和GMV（网站成交金额），有近70%的商家在两个及以上的电商平台开店，全国多个平台间的补货送仓是商家物流环节非常重要的一项工作。尤其是大促时，大量商品集中送仓，场地不足、分货难、运力紧缺、无法按预约时间准时送仓、异常处理难等一系列物流问题，都会消耗商家很多运营精力，影响促销节奏。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">为了提升送仓服务效率，2月1日，由京东物流到仓服务精心打造的&ldquo;京准送仓&rdquo;新产品正式上线，致力于为多平台商家提供更经济、更精准、更专业的高品质一站式补货送仓服务。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/91624/23/21272/221284/63e3391aFfa3bbc86/0a35a701b3d3cb3b.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">全网覆盖</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">● 40000余条线路 覆盖主流平台仓 ●</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;京准送仓&rdquo;产品聚焦产地至销地的核心网络，<strong>4万余条运输线路，300+城市提供上门揽收服务，其中33个城市支持当日预约、当日揽收服务，全国40万㎡TC转运中心操作场地，支持按采购单灵活分货服务。商家只需对接一个物流商，即可满足全国性补货需求</strong>，有效分担了商家对接多家物流公司的压力，服务更周全，资源调度更灵活。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/75685/30/19058/162846/63e3395bFff0dd162/31a12dc20fca4eea.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">价格经济</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">● 送仓费10元/单 货量越大越优惠 ●</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">为帮助商家降低送仓成本，&ldquo;京准送仓&rdquo;产品计费模式全年恒定，旺季不涨价，同时提供更具吸引力的5档阶梯报价，超低送仓费，同一家客户发货量越大、价格越优惠。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">专业服务</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">● 专业交仓员驻场 按预约时效准时送仓 ●</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">预约送仓准时率是评价送仓服务的关键指标。为严格保障货物如约送达，到仓服务通过两项关键举措提升商家一次送仓成功率。首先，<strong>在全国平台仓配备熟悉交仓规则的驻场交仓员，专人专仓，整体交仓效率提升15%以上</strong>。其次，<strong>配备专属的商家协同岗人员，异常问题快速响应优先处理</strong>。除此之外，<strong>物流售后服务升级，理赔场景更宽泛，丢损类异常5-7天处理闭环</strong>，全程为商家提供高品质服务。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">新年过后，电商物流迎来新一波送仓高峰。到仓服务将继续以客户需求为出发点，通过健全完善&ldquo;京准送仓&rdquo;产品，提供更优质的送仓服务，优化物流效率，缩短送货时长，帮助越来越多品牌商家从容应对管理难度和业务挑战，降本增效，实现物流业务的高质量发展。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/165395/5/31327/43354/63e339c8F2dbeda66/9118752e37217f49.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "三大优势助力电商企业效率提升。", "contentCode": "content01045", "contentTitle": "4万余条线路，京东物流推出“京准送仓”新产品", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1675835270000, "id": 2840, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "resCode": "100097", "srcUrl": "/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/208556/14/27920/162846/63e339dfF7cf34ab2/269bd4c49de7665f.png", "updateTime": 1675835948000}], "pageSize": 5, "totalItems": 1542, "totalPages": 309}}